      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CLASSIC LASS (2) has missed the frame at last two runs but could not have been more impressive the run prior in her sharp 18.25 win at Richmond over 320m. Should be in this for a long way. ADA TARO (8) is progressing well scoring last time out (18.37) at this track and bringing up her 9th career win. Solid record here at the distance winning six races. Ran one of the fastest times on the program in her latest win. Makes plenty of appeal if runs up to latest. IRINKA FRED (4) is a well performed dog and winner of 13 races who is worth forgiving after finishing out of the placings at this track (19.13). Form here at the trip excellent including six wins. In the mix. DANIEL KEEPING (1) has been in the money at his last two runs, most recently when third (18.72) in a Grade 3/4 over 318m at this track.",
